"1. 长时间轻负载插电：观察电量是否主要停留在保持区间内，而不是频繁刚掉一点就补电。" = "1. Long plugged-in light-load run: check whether capacity mostly stays inside the hold band instead of topping up again after every tiny drop.";
"2. 中高负载插电：观察电量是否持续下滑，以及当前生效保持策略是否会自动切换。" = "2. Medium/high plugged-in load: check whether capacity drifts down slowly inside the hold band, and only resumes charging after it falls below the lower bound.";
"3. 温控往返：观察接近高温阈值后是否暂停充电，降温后是否平稳恢复。" = "3. Thermal round-trip: check whether charging pauses near the thermal limit and resumes smoothly after cooling down.";
"4. Smart Charge 接管：观察进入 hold/stop 时是否临时停用，退出后或 daemon 重启后是否恢复。" = "4. Smart Charge takeover: check whether it is temporarily disabled when entering hold/stop, and whether it restores after exit or a daemon restart.";
"5. 若结果不理想，优先调整补电阈值、检查间隔，再考虑温控阈值。" = "5. If results are not ideal, tune the top-up threshold and check interval first, then consider thermal thresholds.";
